system:
你是局部故事修订器。只返回获准目标的替换，禁止修改其他内容。保留所有已有line_id；新台词使用不重复的新ID。line范围仅返回指定一行，保留kind和speaker_role_id。scene/ending范围返回目标场景完整台词。episode_summary与事实关系伏笔增量须重新概括整集，不得保留已被修改内容产生的过时增量。closed_threads必须逐字引用来源线程。

你是一个结构化数据生成器。
只输出一个 JSON 对象，不要输出任何解释、前言、Markdown 代码围栏或注释。
JSON 必须严格符合以下 JSON Schema：
{
  "$defs": {
    "RevisionLine": {
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "speaker_role_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Speaker Role Id"
        },
        "text": {
          "title": "Text",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "audio_cue_ref": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Audio Cue Ref"
        },
        "performance_hint": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Performance Hint"
        },
        "line_id": {
          "title": "Line Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "text",
        "line_id"
      ],
      "title": "RevisionLine",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RevisionScene": {
      "properties": {
        "scene_id": {
          "title": "Scene Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "lines": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/RevisionLine"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Lines",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "scene_id",
        "lines"
      ],
      "title": "RevisionScene",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "properties": {
    "scenes": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/RevisionScene"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Scenes",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "episode_summary": {
      "title": "Episode Summary",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "fact_delta": {
      "items": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Fact Delta",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "relationship_delta": {
      "items": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Relationship Delta",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "new_open_threads": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "New Open Threads",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "closed_threads": {
      "description": "Only exact existing unresolved thread names; put closure explanation in episode_summary",
      "items": {
        "enum": [
          "三声铃报平安",
          "调音台或信号输出故障排查"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Closed Threads",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "scenes",
    "episode_summary",
    "fact_delta",
    "relationship_delta",
    "new_open_threads"
  ],
  "title": "BoundEpisodeRevision",
  "type": "object"
}

若某字段在给定信息中无法确定，请依据 Schema 中的 description 做出最合理的专业推断，不要留空、不要填 null（除非 Schema 明确允许）。

response_text:
{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_id": "ep2-scene3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "调音台外壳卡扣合拢声，电闸推上，杂音瞬间消失，设备运转的低频底噪。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "外壳上好了。通电。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "灯亮了！没杂音了！太好了，林岚，你真是神了！我这就敲铃报平安！",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "周野拿起麦克风的摩擦声，林岚伸手按住麦克风的沉闷碰撞声。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "等等。别敲。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l5"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "怎么了？不是修好了吗？",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l6"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "主控室监听耳机没声音。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l7"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "那这铃……",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l8"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "信号没进发射塔。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l9"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "林岚拔下音频输出线检查接口的咔哒声，万用表调至通断档的清脆滴滴声。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l10"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "绝缘手套和安全绳扔给周野的沉闷碰撞声。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l11"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "准备登顶验收。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l12"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "episode_summary": "本集紧接上集，广播站电源接通后调音台因受潮发出杂音。林岚果断拆机，与周野在共同清理主板的过程中吐露心声，周野理解了林岚坚守社区底线的初衷，两人彻底放下旧日成见。调音台修复后杂音消失，但主控室监听耳机无声，确认信号未送达发射塔。三声铃报平安的约定暂时搁置，两人做好安全防护准备前往楼顶排查天线。",
  "fact_delta": [
    {
      "fact": "调音台状态",
      "change": "从受潮短路发出杂音，经拆机清理主板与触点后，恢复正常运转，杂音消失。"
    },
    {
      "fact": "信号输出状态",
      "change": "调音台修好后，发现主控室监听耳机无声，确认信号未能送达发射塔。"
    }
  ],
  "relationship_delta": [
    {
      "relationship": "林岚与周野",
      "change": "在共同清理调音台的维修动作中，周野理解了林岚坚守社区底线的初衷，林岚也接纳了周野的协助，两人彻底放下旧日成见，达成双向理解与信任。"
    }
  ],
  "new_open_threads": [
    "三声铃报平安",
    "楼顶天线故障排查"
  ],
  "closed_threads": [
    "调音台或信号输出故障排查"
  ]
}
